# there to keep the architect's plans out of an image, and this one is the
# opposite of that: a house that does not exist, drawn by tools/fixture_plan.py
# and committed on purpose. Without the exception the image has no plan.pdf and
# eighteen tests fail inside the container while passing outside it.
!app/tests/drawings/*.pdf
